<div role="listitem" class="product-benefits_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="products_card"><a tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/products/volkswagen-t5-t6-swb" class="products_link w-inline-block"></a><div class="products_image-wrap"><div class="products_badge-wrap"><div class="badge is-white is-shadow"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-richtext"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7" fill="#437ef7"/><path d="M4.5 7.5L6.5 9.5 10.5 5.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div><div>Volkswagen</div></div></div><img src="images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-500.webp 500w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-800.webp 800w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-1080.webp 1080w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-1600.webp 1600w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-2000.webp 2000w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n.webp 2048w" class="products_image"/></div><div class="products_info-wrap"><div class="products_content-link-wrap"><div class="text-size-small">Elevated Roof</div><div class="products_header-wrap"><h2 class="heading-style-h6">T5 &amp; T6 SWB</h2></div></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-light text-style-3lines w-richtext"><p>The Volkswagen Transporter T5 and T6 short-wheelbase models are popular choices for campervan conversions, offering a good balance of size and manoeuvrability. It's what makes them one of the most common sights across campsites and green spaces throughout the UK and Europe. Now, you can maximise the interior space of your SWB Transporter even further with a Skyrule Volkswagen T5 &amp; T6 SWB front elevating roof conversion, creating a comfortable and versatile living area with invaluable extra headroom when needed.</p></div></div><div data-theme="dark" class="products_button-wrap"><a data-wf--button--size="small" href="/products/volkswagen-t5-t6-swb" class="button-wrap w-variant-0fa6310e-3b03-4614-cc31-5599b3d7993a w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-style--style="primary" class="button-content w-variant-2322bba7-d743-d5ae-17b2-3a616235fc2a"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">View Product</div><div class="button-icon"><div class="icon-slot"><div class="icon-slot"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 17" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_6401_1558)"><path d="M10.9541 3.45557L6.00455 3.49545L5.99226 5.02155L10.5927 4.98503L3.05492 12.5549L4.12551 13.6255L11.6959 6.02298L11.6583 10.6887L13.1844 10.6764L13.2249 5.72629C13.2282 5.11964 12.9913 4.5402 12.5657 4.11468C12.1402 3.68916 11.5608 3.45218 10.9541 3.45557Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_6401_1558"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(0 0.5)"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div>
<div role="listitem" class="product-benefits_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="products_card"><a tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/products/volkswagen-t5-t6-lwb" class="products_link w-inline-block"></a><div class="products_image-wrap"><div class="products_badge-wrap"><div class="badge is-white is-shadow"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-richtext"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7" fill="#437ef7"/><path d="M4.5 7.5L6.5 9.5 10.5 5.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div><div>Volkswagen</div></div></div><img src="images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-500.webp 500w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-800.webp 800w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-1080.webp 1080w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-1600.webp 1600w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n.webp 2048w" class="products_image"/></div><div class="products_info-wrap"><div class="products_content-link-wrap"><div class="text-size-small">Elevated Roof</div><div class="products_header-wrap"><h2 class="heading-style-h6">T5 &amp; T6 LWB</h2></div></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-light text-style-3lines w-richtext"><p>The Volkswagen Transporter T5 and T6 models are some of the most popular base vehicles for camper van conversion — both readily customisable and highly versatile vehicles, and if you have the long wheelbase variant, there's even more you can do with the extended interior space. We've been fans of the Transporter since the early models — and we've developed our front-elevating roof to make the most of the T5 and T6's potential.</p></div></div><div data-theme="dark" class="products_button-wrap"><a data-wf--button--size="small" href="/products/volkswagen-t5-t6-lwb" class="button-wrap w-variant-0fa6310e-3b03-4614-cc31-5599b3d7993a w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-style--style="primary" class="button-content w-variant-2322bba7-d743-d5ae-17b2-3a616235fc2a"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">View Product</div><div class="button-icon"><div class="icon-slot"><div class="icon-slot"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 17" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_6401_1558)"><path d="M10.9541 3.45557L6.00455 3.49545L5.99226 5.02155L10.5927 4.98503L3.05492 12.5549L4.12551 13.6255L11.6959 6.02298L11.6583 10.6887L13.1844 10.6764L13.2249 5.72629C13.2282 5.11964 12.9913 4.5402 12.5657 4.11468C12.1402 3.68916 11.5608 3.45218 10.9541 3.45557Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clippath id="clip0_6401_1558"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(0 0.5)"></rect></clippath></defs></svg></div></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div>
